WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:24.922
Kip felt awful.

2
00:00:24.923 --> 00:00:31.885
He left the pizza crust on his branch.

3
00:00:31.886 --> 00:00:36.063
He went into his hole.

4
00:00:36.064 --> 00:00:42.413
"Bird doesn't want a pizza crust," he thought.

5
00:00:42.414 --> 00:00:56.944
"She wants noodle soup, blankets, and tea."

6
00:00:56.945 --> 00:01:03.881
Kip made noodle soup and tea.

7
00:01:03.882 --> 00:01:09.314
He found some blankets.

8
00:01:09.315 --> 00:01:27.989
"I'll bring these things to Bird," he said.

9
00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:33.459
"Hi, Bird," said Kip.

10
00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:38.311
"Ah-choo!" said Bird.

11
00:01:38.312 --> 00:01:42.341
"I brought you some things," said Kip.

12
00:01:42.342 --> 00:01:45.467
Kip gave the soup and the tea to Bird.

13
00:01:45.468 --> 00:01:48.602
Kip put the blankets over Bird's feet.

14
00:01:48.603 --> 00:01:53.242
"Thanks, Kip," said Bird.

15
00:01:53.243 --> 00:01:57.283
Then Bird noticed the pizza crust.

16
00:01:57.284 --> 00:01:59.620
"Oh!" said Bird.

17
00:01:59.621 --> 00:02:03.059
"Is that pizza crust for me too?"

18
00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.127
Kip was surprised.

19
00:02:06.128 --> 00:02:16.078
"Um, yes," said Kip.

20
00:02:16.079 --> 00:02:19.668
"It is for you."

21
00:02:19.669 --> 00:02:26.236
"Pizza crust is my favorite," said Bird.

22
00:02:26.237 --> 00:02:33.003
"You know just what I like, Kip!"

23
00:02:33.004 --> 00:02:40.860
"Mmm," said Bird. "I'm feeling better already!"

24
00:02:40.861 --> 00:02:42.485
Kip smiled.

25
00:02:42.486 --> 00:02:48.831
He was feeling better too.
